error[E0083]: 'Outer' literal omits field(s) with no zero value: 'b'
  --> error_struct_no_zero_value.bit:21:11
   |
21 |   let o = Outer{ a: 1 }
   |           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^ a class-typed field is a reference and would be null; a payload-carrying enum's zero tag names a variant that has no payload to give it — give each one a value (§13.4)
error[E0083]: 'Outer' cannot be default-constructed: field(s) with no zero value: 'b'
  --> error_struct_no_zero_value.bit:25:7
